    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "CME Estate Agents warmly welcomes you to No.4 Capella Court, a very well presented modern 2 bed, 2 bath top floor apartment located in this gated and convenient development. No 4 comes to the market in very good condition with new carpets throughout and revamped kitchen. Ideally located only minutes from the bustling town of Newbridge with an array of shops including Dunnes, Tesco, Aldi and the Whitewater shopping centre and only minutes from the M7/M9 making commuting a viable option. The nearby train station offers frequent services also ideal for commuters. Capella Court itself is a secure and gated development which is well maintained and offers ample parking for residents, both underground and surface level. Viewing is highly recommended & by appointment with CME."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: c. 2.2m x 1.5m\r\nNewly fitted carpet.\r\n\r\nHotpress: \r\nWith ample storage: (Please Note: Requires replacement water pump)\r\n\r\nLounge: c. 3.8m x 3.45m\r\nNewly fitted carpets. French doors leading to balcony.\r\n\r\nDining Area: c. 2.75m x 2.70m\r\nNewly fitted carpet.\r\n\r\nKitchen Area: c. 2.35m x 2.0m\r\nWith a range of modern fitted wall & floor units. Stainless steel sink unit. Walnut effect work surfaces. Partly tiled walls. Tiled floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: c.4.25m x 2.80m\r\nNewly fitted carpet. Floor to ceiling fitted wardrobes. Corner window.\r\n\r\nEnsuite: \r\nc. 2.1m x 1.75m\r\nWith WC, wash hand basin & shower enclosure. Tiled floor and wet areas.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: c. 3.1m x 2.8m\r\nNewly fitted carpet. Built-in wardrobes.\r\n\r\nBathroom: \r\nWith WC, wash hand basin & bath. Tiled floor & wet areas. Glass shower screen.\r\n\r\nOutside: \r\nSecure, Gated development with designated parking, both surface and underground. Secure block entrance via code. Elevator in building. Well maintained and managed communal area and gardens."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "2 bed/2 bath top floor unit\r\nGated, secure development \r\nAmple surface and underground car parking \r\nNewly fitted carpet & neutral decor throughout\r\nUpgraded kitchen \r\nPresented in very good condition\r\nElevator in building\r\nIntercom access to building"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "Sandra Banim"
      }
